    "updated_at": "2017-01-31T09:01:09Z",
    "body": "The problem is that we don't know if it's stable until all of it's been shipped in a couple of browsers. I wouldn't want to promise anything like that only for it to not be true. What's wrong with continuing to iterate and declare it stable once we know it is?",
